/* template_finalize: full MD5CRYPT chain (3 steps + 1000-iter loop).
 *
 * Step 1: digest_b = MD5(pass || raw_salt || pass)
 * Step 2: digest_a = MD5(pass || "$1$" || raw_salt
 *                        || digest_b-chunked-by-16-for-plen-bytes
 *                        || bit-loop-bytes)
